msgid "Summary of Network"
msgstr "网络摘要"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

msgid "Number of nodes"
msgstr "节点数"

msgid "Number of included edges"
msgstr "包含的边数"

msgid "Number of excluded edges"
msgstr "排除的边数"

msgid "Number of edges with inconclusive evidence"
msgstr "证据尚无定论的边数"

msgid "Sparsity"
msgstr "稀疏性"

msgid ""
"Edge categorization is based on the inclusion criteria BF: included (BF₁₀ ≥ "
"threshold), excluded (BF₁₀ ≤ 1/threshold), inconclusive (otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"边的分类基于包含标准 BF：包含（BF₁₀ ≥ 阈值）、排除（BF₁₀ ≤ 1/阈值）、尚无定论"
"（其他情况）。"

msgid "Could not determine the baseline category for variable %s."
msgstr "无法确定变量 %s 的基线类别。"

msgid ""
"Some model type assignments refer to variables that are not part of the "
"analysis: %s."
msgstr "某些模型类型分配所引用的变量并不在分析范围内：%s。"

msgid "Variable %s cannot be treated as Blume-Capel because it is not ordinal."
msgstr "变量 %s 不能按 Blume-Capel 处理，因为它不是有序变量。"

msgid ""
"The Stochastic block model edge prior is not available when Split is "
"selected. Please use Bernoulli or Beta-binomial."
msgstr ""
"在选择“拆分”时不可使用随机块模型边先验。请使用 Bernoulli 或 Beta-二项分布。"

msgid ""
"The Beta-prime prior on the partial association parameters is not available "
"when continuous variables are included. Please select Normal or Cauchy."
msgstr ""
"当包含连续变量时，偏关联参数的 Beta-prime 先验不可用。请选择 Normal 或 Cauchy"
"。"

msgid ""
"The analysis failed with the following error message:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"分析失败，错误信息如下：\n"
"%s"

msgid "The cluster summaries could not be matched to the variables."
msgstr "聚类汇总无法与变量匹配。"

msgid "The cluster allocations could not be matched to the variables."
msgstr "聚类分配无法与变量匹配。"

msgid "The posterior samples could not be matched to the variable pairs."
msgstr "后验样本无法与变量对匹配。"

msgid "The group estimates could not be matched to the variable pairs."
msgstr "组估计无法与变量对匹配。"

msgid ""
"Unsupported update method '%s'. Please select one of: adaptive-metropolis, "
"nuts, gibbs."
msgstr "不支持的更新方法“%s”。请选择以下之一：adaptive-metropolis、nuts、gibbs。"

msgid ""
"Unsupported edge prior '%s'. Please select one of: Bernoulli, Beta-binomial, "
"Stochastic block model."
msgstr ""
"不支持的边先验“%s”。请选择以下之一：Bernoulli、Beta-二项分布、随机块模型。"

msgid "Group"
msgstr "组"

msgid "Estimating group comparison"
msgstr "正在估计组间比较"

msgid ""
"The group comparison failed with the following error message:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"组比较失败，错误信息如下：\n"
"%s"

msgid "Differences"
msgstr "差异"

msgid "Estimating pooled network"
msgstr "正在估计合并网络"

msgid "Pooled"
msgstr "合并"

msgid "Estimating %s"
msgstr "正在估计 %s"

msgid "Estimating network"
msgstr "正在估计网络"

msgid ""
"Difference network not estimated: all selected variables must be ordinal or "
"Blume-Capel. Showing separate group estimates instead."
msgstr ""
"未估计差异网络：所有选定的变量必须为有序或 Blume-Capel。改为显示各组的单独估"
"计。"

msgid ""
"Minimum edge strength ignored in the network plot because it was larger than "
"the absolute value of the strongest edge."
msgstr "网络图中最小边强度被忽略，因为它大于最强边的绝对值。"

msgid ""
"Minimum edge strength ignored in the network plot of group%1$s %2$s because "
"it was larger than the absolute value of the strongest edge."
msgstr "组%1$s %2$s 中的网络图中最小边强度被忽略，因为它大于最强边的绝对值。"

msgid "<em>Warning: </em>"
msgstr "<em>警告: </em>"

msgid "Number of different edges"
msgstr "不同的边数"

msgid "Number of equal edges"
msgstr "相等的边数"

msgid "Posterior Probability Structure Plots"
msgstr "后验概率结构图"

msgid "Posterior Probability Structure Plot"
msgstr "后验概率结构图"

msgid "Centrality measures per variable"
msgstr "每个变量中心性度量"

msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

msgid ""
"Centrality measures are standardized to z-scores across nodes and averaged "
"over the networks sampled from the posterior."
msgstr "中心性指标按节点标准化为 z 分数，并对从后验中采样的网络取平均。"

msgid ""
"Centrality measures are standardized to z-scores across nodes and computed "
"on the posterior mean network."
msgstr "中心性指标按节点标准化为 z 分数，并基于后验均值网络计算。"

msgid "Betweenness"
msgstr "介数（Betweenness）"

msgid "Closeness"
msgstr "接近度（Closeness）"

msgid "Strength"
msgstr "强度"

msgid "Expected influence"
msgstr "期望影响"

msgid "Centrality Plot"
msgstr "中心性图"

msgid "Parameter HDI Plot"
msgstr "参数 HDI 图"

msgid "Parameter HDI Plots"
msgstr "参数 HDI 图"

msgid ""
"The difference parameter HDI plot shows the posterior mean and highest "
"density interval (HDI) for each pairwise difference in partial association "
"between groups. Differences are the second group minus the first: positive "
"values indicate a stronger association in the second group; negative values "
"indicate a stronger association in the first group."
msgstr ""
"差异参数 HDI 图显示各组之间每对偏关联差异的后验均值与最高密度区间（HDI）。差"
"异为第二组减第一组：正值表示第二组的关联更强；负值表示第一组的关联更强。"

msgid ""
"Posterior samples are required for the parameter HDI. Please ensure the "
"model was fitted with 'save = TRUE'."
msgstr "参数 HDI 需要后验样本。请确保模型在拟合时设置“save = TRUE”。"

msgid ""
"The posterior samples are not in the expected edge order. Please report "
"this, as the parameter HDI output cannot be labelled reliably."
msgstr "后验样本的边顺序与预期不符。请报告此问题，因为参数 HDI 输出无法可靠地标注。"

msgid "%d%% HDI of Partial Association"
msgstr "偏关联的 %d%% HDI"

msgid "Complexity plot"
msgstr "复杂性图"

msgid "Complexity plots"
msgstr "复杂性图"

msgid "Complexity Plot"
msgstr "复杂性图"

msgid "Posterior Probability"
msgstr "后验概率"

msgid "Number of edges"
msgstr "边数"

msgid "Structure Plot"
msgstr "结构图"

msgid "Structure Plots"
msgstr "结构图"

msgid "Edge Evidence Plot"
msgstr "边证据图"

msgid "Edge Evidence Plots"
msgstr "边证据图"

msgid "Edge evidence probability table"
msgstr "边证据概率表"

msgid ""
"Bayes factors with values of infinity indicate that the estimated posterior "
"inclusion probability is either 1 or 0. Please see the help file for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"贝叶斯因子的值为无穷大，表示估计的后验包含概率为 1 或 0。更多信息请参阅帮助文"
"件。"

msgid "Edge Specific Overview"
msgstr "边特定概览"

msgid "difference"
msgstr "差异"

msgid "equal"
msgstr "相等"

msgid "inconclusive"
msgstr "尚无定论"

msgid "Relation"
msgstr "关系"

msgid "Difference Estimate"
msgstr "差异估计"

msgid "The pairwise group differences could not be matched to the groups."
msgstr "成对组间差异无法与组匹配。"

msgid "%1$s − %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s − %2$s"

msgid "Difference"
msgstr "差值"

msgid "Posterior Diff. Prob."
msgstr "后验差异概率"

msgid "Difference BF"
msgstr "差异 BF"

msgid "Category"
msgstr "类别"

msgid "Convergence (baseline)"
msgstr "收敛性（基线）"

msgid "Convergence"
msgstr "收敛"

msgid "Estimate"
msgstr "估计"

msgid ""
"Difference estimates are based on the median probability model: edges with a "
"posterior difference probability ≤ 0.5 are set to zero."
msgstr "差异估计基于中位概率模型：后验差异概率 ≤ 0.5 的边设为零。"

msgid ""
"Group estimates are posterior means of the joint model used for the group "
"comparison; a difference that is not set to zero equals the difference "
"between the corresponding group estimates."
msgstr ""
"组估计是用于组比较的联合模型的后验均值；未设为零的差异等于相应组估计之间的差"
"异。"

msgid ""
"Pooled estimates come from a separate fit to the pooled data and are based "
"on its median probability model."
msgstr "合并估计来自对合并数据的单独拟合，并基于其中位概率模型。"

msgid ""
"Bayes factors with values of infinity indicate that the estimated posterior "
"difference probability is either 1 or 0. Please see the help file for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"贝叶斯因子的值为无穷大，表示估计的后验差异概率为 1 或 0。更多信息请参阅帮助文"
"件。"

msgid ""
"Convergence is the R-hat (Gelman-Rubin) statistic of the baseline pairwise "
"interactions of the joint model; the group comparison does not report a "
"separate R-hat for the differences themselves. Values greater than about "
"1.01-1.05 are considered concerning. Consider increasing the number of "
"iterations and/or chains to improve convergence."
msgstr ""
"收敛性为基线成对交互的 R-hat（Gelman-Rubin）统计量；组比较不单独报告差异本身"
"的 R-hat。大于约 1.01–1.05 的值值得关注。可考虑增加迭代次数和/或链数以改善收"
"敛。"

msgid ""
"Convergence is the R-hat (Gelman-Rubin) statistic, values greater than about "
"1.01-1.05 are considered concerning, indicating potential lack of "
"convergence for the estimates of the pairwise interactions. Consider "
"increasing the number of iterations and/or chains to improve convergence."
msgstr ""
"收敛性为 R-hat（Gelman-Rubin）统计量，大于约 1.01-1.05 的值被认为值得关注，表"
"明成对交互的估计可能缺乏收敛。可考虑增加迭代次数和/或链数以改善收敛。"

msgid ""
"Convergence is the split-chain R-hat (Gelman-Rubin) statistic, computed post "
"hoc by splitting the posterior samples into two halves."
msgstr ""
"收敛性为分裂链 R-hat（Gelman-Rubin）统计量，通过将后验样本一分为二事后计算得"
"出。"

msgid "included"
msgstr "包含"

msgid "excluded"
msgstr "排除"

msgid "Posterior Incl. Prob."
msgstr "后验包含概率"

msgid "Inclusion BF"
msgstr "包含 BF"

msgid ""
"Estimates are based on the median probability model: edges with a posterior "
"inclusion probability ≤ 0.5 are set to zero."
msgstr "估计基于中位概率模型：后验包含概率 ≤ 0.5 的边设为零。"

msgid ""
"Convergence is the R-hat (Gelman-Rubin) statistic, with values greater than "
"about 1.01-1.05 are considered concerning, indicating potential lack of "
"convergence for the estimates of the pairwise interactions. Consider "
"increasing the number of iterations to improve convergence."
msgstr ""
"收敛性为 R-hat（Gelman-Rubin）统计量，大于约 1.01-1.05 的值被认为值得关注，表"
"明成对交互的估计可能缺乏收敛。可考虑增加迭代次数以改善收敛。"

msgid ""
"Convergence is the split-chain R-hat (Gelman-Rubin) statistic, computed post "
"hoc by splitting the posterior samples into two halves. Values greater than "
"about 1.01-1.05 are considered concerning, indicating potential lack of "
"convergence for the estimates of the pairwise interactions. Consider "
"increasing the number of iterations to improve convergence."
msgstr ""
"收敛性为分裂链 R-hat（Gelman-Rubin）统计量，通过将后验样本一分为二事后计算得"
"出。大于约 1.01-1.05 的值被认为值得关注，表明成对交互的估计可能缺乏收敛。可考"
"虑增加迭代次数以改善收敛。"

msgid "Blume-Capel Main Effects"
msgstr "Blume-Capel 主效应"

msgid "%s%% Credible Interval"
msgstr "%s%% 可信区间"

msgid "Effect"
msgstr "效应"

msgid "Baseline Category"
msgstr "基线类别"

msgid "Posterior SD"
msgstr "后验标准差"

msgid "Lower"
msgstr "下限"

msgid "Upper"
msgstr "上限"

msgid ""
"The linear (α) and quadratic (β) contributions of the Blume-Capel model for "
"the category thresholds, reported relative to the baseline category the "
"variable was fitted with."
msgstr ""
"Blume-Capel 模型对类别阈值的线性（α）和二次（β）贡献，相对于变量拟合时使用的"
"基线类别报告。"

msgid "Linear"
msgstr "线性"

msgid "Quadratic"
msgstr "二次项"

msgid ""
"Convergence is the R-hat (Gelman-Rubin) statistic, values greater than about "
"1.01-1.05 are considered concerning, indicating potential lack of "
"convergence for the estimates of the main effects. Consider increasing the "
"number of iterations and/or chains to improve convergence."
msgstr ""
"收敛性为 R-hat（Gelman-Rubin）统计量，大于约 1.01–1.05 的值值得关注，表明主效"
"应估计可能缺乏收敛。可考虑增加迭代次数和/或链数以改善收敛。"

msgid "Parameter HDI Table"
msgstr "参数 HDI 表"

msgid "%d%% HDI"
msgstr "%d%% HDI"

msgid "Posterior Mean"
msgstr "后验均值"

msgid "Median Probability Model Estimate"
msgstr "中位概率模型估计"

msgid ""
"The posterior mean averages over all posterior samples, including those in "
"which the edge is excluded, so it can be nonzero when the HDI collapses onto "
"zero. The median probability model estimate sets edges with a posterior "
"inclusion probability ≤ 0.5 to zero, matching the edge specific overview "
"table."
msgstr ""
"后验均值是对所有后验样本的平均，包括边被排除的样本，因此当 HDI 收缩到零时其后"
"验均值仍可能非零。中位概率模型估计将后验包含概率 ≤ 0.5 的边设为零，与按边列出"
"的概览表一致。"

msgid "Log-odds"
msgstr "对数几率（Log-odds）"

msgid "Partial Correlations"
msgstr "偏相关"

